# Keep line endings consistent across Windows / Linux / macOS contributors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden vectors are byte-exact inputs to the test benches. If git rewrote their
# line endings their md5 would change and "did the vectors change?" would become
# unanswerable, which defeats the point of committing them.
*.mem binary
*.npz binary
*.bit binary
*.bin binary
*.xsa binary

# The two Vitis build scripts must keep their UTF-8 BOM: PowerShell 5.1 decodes
# BOM-less .ps1 as the system ANSI code page (GBK here), the non-ASCII comments
# then garble the parse, and the error points at the wrong line.
board/baremetal/build_elf.ps1     -text
board/baremetal/build_bootbin.ps1 -text
